From 13119f16bbbd8ecb71fd82db04595b086658f258 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jakob Lichterfeld <jakob-lichterfeld@gmx.de>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 09:23:15 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] fix(api): redact the userinfo of a URL in errors and
 request logs

A URL's userinfo, e.g. credentials in TESLA_AUTH_HOST, reached the log unredacted: in the auth client's request line and in the URL of every TeslaApi.Error. TeslaApi.Error.redact_url/1 now redacts userinfo and sensitive query parameters and replaces the second copy in TeslaApi; the auth client logs its request line through TeslaApi.format_log/3.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
